ValueSet: TWCMPulsePosition
Id: twcm-pulseposition
Title: "中醫脈診部位值集"
Description: "中醫寸口脈診之寸、關、尺三部位值集，取自 WHOICTMTerminology 代碼系統之寸脈（884）、關脈（885）、尺脈（886）。左右手則記錄於 Observation.bodySite。"
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
* WHOICTMTerminology#884 "寸脈"
* WHOICTMTerminology#885 "關脈"
* WHOICTMTerminology#886 "尺脈"
